---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="About | BatteryTrail"
    description="BatteryTrail is an independent guide to RV batteries, ebike batteries, and lithium battery technology. Learn who runs it and why it exists."
>
    <Header />

    <main class="flex-grow w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
        <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[#224249] pb-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]">
                About BatteryTrail
            </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-a:text-primary prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
            <p>
                BatteryTrail is an independent publication for people who power
                their adventures with batteries. We publish in-depth guides,
                comparisons, and practical tips covering RV batteries, ebike power
                systems, and lithium battery technology — the things you actually
                need to know to keep your rig running and your rides rolling.
            </p>

            <h2>What We Cover</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>RV batteries</strong> — lithium upgrades, battery bank
                    sizing, charging, winter care, and brand comparisons.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Ebike batteries</strong> — range, maintenance, charging
                    habits, replacement, and buying guides.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Lithium battery technology</strong> — LiFePO4
                    chemistry, battery management systems, safety, and
                    certifications.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Why We Exist</h2>
            <p>
                Battery buying advice is crowded with marketing and stale
                information. BatteryTrail exists to cut through it — comparing
                products on the numbers that matter (cycle life, cost per cycle,
                weight, warranty, and real-world performance) so you can make a
                confident decision without weeks of research.
            </p>

            <h2>Who Runs It</h2>
            <p>
                BatteryTrail is written and operated by
                <strong>Chester Beard</strong>. Our recommendations are based on
                manufacturer specifications, published testing, and hands-on use.
                Where we earn a commission through affiliate links, it never
                changes the price you pay or the honesty of our comparisons.
            </p>

            <h2>How to Reach Us</h2>
            <p>
                Questions, corrections, or ideas for a guide we should write?
                Contact us at
                <a href="mailto:chesterbeard@salishseaconsulting.com">chesterbeard@salishseaconsulting.com</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
</Layout>
